~ start

Troy: Alright. Send them in. One at a time.

do enter_right("Alyssa")
Alyssa: Am I the right size?
Troy: Ask the man holding the ruler. That's not me.
do leave_right("Alyssa")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Layla")
Layla: This had better be a flattering angle.
Troy: It's the only angle you have.
do leave_right("Layla")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Professor")
Professor: I have office hours in ten minutes.
Troy: This will take nine.
do leave_right("Professor")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Julian")
Julian: So this is the famous test scene.
Troy: This is the famous test scene.
do leave_right("Julian")
do wait(0.45)

Troy: That's everyone. Press R to run it again.
=> END
